ts the parent's criterion checks and reports verified_ratio, so this is a framing mismatch on the same parent clause rather than a redefinition or omission of the deliverable — but the leaf does not reconcile its 'no threshold here' stance with the epic's ≥95% target or state that the epic-level bar is satisfied via this manifest.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f72d6ddedcf842594","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"Leaf AC2 vs parent epic 759e-7dc1-675c-4877 Acceptance Criterion 1","norm_id":"n0659229ded93587c","priority":0.2357,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["The real build reconstructs <95% of v2 sidecars and the leaf ships anyway because it asserts no threshold, leaving the epic's Criterion 1 (≥95%) unmet with no owner between the two tickets.","A reviewer of the epic reads the manifest expecting a ≥95% pass/fail and instead finds only a reported ratio with no acceptance statement."],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"Add a sentence to leaf AC2 clarifying that the epic's ≥95% verification bar is evaluated at the epic level against this manifest's coverage counts, and that this ticket's obligation is to produce and report the (per-candidate) verified_ratio faithfully — not that the ≥95% target is dropped.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.4286,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"insufficient","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"na","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"none","divergent_implementation":"incomplete_enumeration","dod_uncerti